584	//  Canonical Major-K smem stager. The ss-wgmma operand smem tile (MN rows x
585	//  K=16 bf16) MUST be in the CUTLASS Major-K INTERLEAVE layout (wgmma.cuh):
586	//      idx(mn,k) = (k/8)*(MN*8) + mn*8 + (k%8)
587	//  This helper writes ONE such MN x 16 tile, pulling element (mn, k) from a
588	//  caller-provided accessor `src(mn, kbase + k)`. Routing the source axis
589	//  through the accessor is what lets the SAME wgmma issue (TransA=0/TransB=0,
590	//  the substrate-validated orientation) serve fwd / dX / dW: the staging loop
591	//  transposes physically; the engine never leaves the gated path.
